This is a list of all circuits currently featured in [[Gran Turismo 7]]. For information on which tracks were added by post-launch updates, see the [[Downloadable Content#Gran Turismo 7 Content|downloadable content]] page.

Information for this page is obtained from this [https://www.gran-turismo.com/us/gt7/tracklist/ list]. Currently, 42 tracks (featuring 85 distinct layouts and 121 total configurations including reverse layouts) are available.

==Tracks==

